{"version": 1, "slug": "tistory-14", "visibility": "public", "title": "[DreamHack] - WindowsPool", "content": "<div class=\"tistory-content\">\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/f10cd93209af03ae75c8c30cde1fdb2b2c85f41d2dacdb1707f289b1d626befa.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>드림핵 WindowsPool</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/5a34509ae277206971c78a0dfc069e1c35a62442830d8f4b370760d133d501fd.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>문제 파일</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/77931ca2fccd845639bbe388853f994497dc92065326435aea5a91de5e2e623d.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>txt안의 구글드라이브에서 다운받은 진짜 문제파일</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/b95d3ced397c3b309fb1fa24e7854e9a7fafe919e0881ac01b2ef3194f3fc316.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>Zip 파일 내부</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pool.vmem : VMware 메모리 덤프</li>\n<li>Pool.vmss : VMware 스냅샷 상태 파일</li>\n<li>hint.txt : 힌트</li>\n</ul>\n<p>바로 hint.txt 열어서 힌트 확인</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/37d36b76575a5944f9f50bd8aef46552ea203fe62925263bd679ab7349f4878d.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>핵심 정보</p>\n<ul>\n<li>함수 : ExAllocatePoolWithTag</li>\n<li>Pool 태그 : looP</li>\n<li>할당 크기 : 0x300 (756bytes)</li>\n<li>매직 시그니처 : <span>0xDEADBEEFCAFEBABE</span></li>\n<li>Flag 위치 : 매직 시그니처 바로 뒤</li>\n</ul>\n<p>-&gt; 메모리 덤프에서 <span>0xDEADBEEFCAFEBABE를 찾으면 그 직후  Flag</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/7fa39c258ea0fee49b91a72c70737d645bc5a70b962b686bb175d3b252da7cda.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>HxD로 파일을 연 후 <span>BE BA FE CA EF BE AD DE를 검색</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/7fa39c258ea0fee49b91a72c70737d645bc5a70b962b686bb175d3b252da7cda.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/3ed9a6caf43e74b2ed4a7787ccb4995926ff10e6602dbd35fdcc7828fcca29b6.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>그 뒤에 Hex 값 <span>70 6F 30 31 5F 41 6C 31 30 63 41 37 65 5F 58 44를 ASCII 코드로 변환하면 Flag 도출</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/62d489f6502db65e26dcd4f337151b09f06436dcef3b2659f8807a7377304e55.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>", "assets": ["37d36b76575a5944f9f50bd8aef46552ea203fe62925263bd679ab7349f4878d.png", "3ed9a6caf43e74b2ed4a7787ccb4995926ff10e6602dbd35fdcc7828fcca29b6.png", "5a34509ae277206971c78a0dfc069e1c35a62442830d8f4b370760d133d501fd.png", "62d489f6502db65e26dcd4f337151b09f06436dcef3b2659f8807a7377304e55.png", "77931ca2fccd845639bbe388853f994497dc92065326435aea5a91de5e2e623d.png", "7fa39c258ea0fee49b91a72c70737d645bc5a70b962b686bb175d3b252da7cda.png", "b95d3ced397c3b309fb1fa24e7854e9a7fafe919e0881ac01b2ef3194f3fc316.png", "f10cd93209af03ae75c8c30cde1fdb2b2c85f41d2dacdb1707f289b1d626befa.png"]}